h level=\"1\" label=\"A few shortcuts on one icon\" /> **What the user does:** You install the app, then press and hold or right click its icon Show a few links like Compose or New tab on the icon menu Jump straight into part of the app Use up to a handful of shortcuts Add many shortcuts"],[295,"<Chips /> Can add quick actions to the icon menu, and offer actions to voice and automation Apps add quick actions to the icon menu and expose actions to voice and automation. A long press on the icon shows a few actions; iOS App Intents also let Siri, Spotlight and Shortcuts run app actions. This puts app features into system surfaces. <Reach level=\"1\" label=\"Only taps you choose\" /> **What the user does:** You long press the app icon, or use Siri and Shortcuts suggestions Show about 4 or 5 qui"],[315,"<Chips /> Can add tickets, boarding passes and loyalty cards to your wallet when you tap Add Adds tickets, loyalty cards and keys to the Wallet app. Passes can appear on the lock screen at a time or place, using location and time relevance without the app running. <Reach level=\"2\" label=\"Only passes you choose to add\" /> **What the user does:** You tap Add to Apple Wallet or Add to Google Wallet Save a pass into your wallet app Show the pass on the lock screen near a set time or place Update the"],[448,"<Chips /> Can add you to an ad list when you visit a site, so ads follow you Ad pixels add a visitor to lists the site owner can later target with ads elsewhere. A tag fires on page load or product view and adds a cookie or hashed email to an audience (for example Meta Custom Audiences, Google remarketing lists, LinkedIn Matched Audiences). Windows run up to 180 days at Meta and 540 days at Google Ads. <Reach level=\"3\" label=\"A list built from your visits\" /> **What the user does:** Nothing. It "],[168,"<Chips /> Can add your driver's license or passport based ID to your phone's wallet Adds a driver's license or passport as a digital ID to the phone wallet. Puts a 